@startuml F1.3-D01-editar-perfil
title F1.3-D01 — Editar dados pessoais (PATCH /me)
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Aluno" as Aluno
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "ProfileController" as Ctrl
participant "UpdateProfileUseCase" as UC
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Aluno -> WebApp: altera telefone / Salvar
WebApp -> Jwt: PATCH /me
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> UC: execute(patch)

note right of UC
  Merge parcial
  GRR / e-mail institucional
  ignorados (allowlist)
end note

UC -> Postgres: UPDATE usuario
Postgres --> UC: OK
UC --> Ctrl: usuario atualizado
Ctrl --> WebApp: 200 OK
WebApp --> Aluno: toast "Perfil atualizado"

@enduml
